Description: guitar tablature and score viewer
 FuTab, a fork of OxiGuitar, opens Guitar Pro files (.gp, .gpx, .gp5,
 .gp4, .gp3) and shows them as standard notation and tablature in four
 layouts, with any set of tracks together. It edits and saves them,
 exports them to PDF, and plays them with the system's sound set or better
 ones the user adds (SoundFont and SFZ). No telemetry: it never uploads
 anything.
 .
 FuTab opens and plays files only through OxiGuitar's plugins, which are
 packages of their own: oxiguitar-guitarpro (Guitar Pro files), oxiguitar-midi
 (sound) and oxiguitar-alsa and oxiguitar-pipewire (audio output), all
 recommended, and oxiguitar-nam (amplifier models), oxiguitar-eq (an
 equalizer), oxiguitar-musicxml (MusicXML files), oxiguitar-midi-file
 (MIDI files) and oxiguitar-tuxguitar (TuxGuitar files), suggested.
